<title>New Zealand: CRICKET-ENGLAND VS NZ NORTHERN DISTRICTS SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND VS NZ NORTHERN DISTRICTS SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard after</p>
<p>England's four-day cricket tour match against Northern</p>
<p>Districts, which finished on the third day on Monday:</p>
<p>Northern Districts</p>
<p>First innings 69</p>
<p>England</p>
<p>First innings 294</p>
<p>Northern Districts</p>
<p>Second innings (overnight 99-1)</p>
<p> B.Pocock lbw b Gough	     69</p>
<p> B.Young c Stewart b Cork	  2</p>
<p> M.Bell b Gough		     35</p>
<p> M.Bailey c Thorpe b Mullally   26</p>
<p> M.Parlane c and b Mullally     74</p>
<p> M.Hart c White b Mullally	 1</p>
<p> R.Hart b White			4</p>
<p> A.Tait c Atherton b White	20</p>
<p> S.Styris b Mullally		13</p>
<p> D.Vettori c Crawley b Gough     1</p>
<p> D.Bennett not out		   4</p>
<p> Extras (lb-3, nb-4, b-3)	 10</p>
<p>  Total (after 91.4 overs)     259</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-9, 2-99, 3-114, 4-156, 5-164, 6-171, 7-212,</p>
<p>8-243, 9-255, 10-259.</p>
<p>Bowling: D.Cork 9-3-23-1, A.Mullally 22.4-7-52-4 (nb-1),</p>
<p>C.White 17-3-61-2 (nb-2), R.Croft 23-5-63-0 (nb-1), D.Gough</p>
<p>19-5-51-3, G.Thorpe 1-0-3-0.</p>
<p>England</p>
<p>Second innings:</p>
<p> N.Knight not out		   24</p>
<p> M.Atherton not out		 12</p>
<p> Extras (1w, 1nb)		    2</p>
<p>    Total (after 8.1 overs)     38</p>
<p>Bowling: S.Styris 1-0-10-0, D.Bennett 4-1-17-0 (nb-1, w-1),</p>
<p>A.Tait 3.1-1-11-0.</p>
<p>Result: England won by 10 wickets.</p>
